eCapture (https://github.com/gojue/ecapture)

The k8s-sniffer agent image vendors a pinned eCapture release binary
(currently v2.4.1) to capture TLS plaintext via eBPF uprobes.

License: Apache License 2.0
https://github.com/gojue/ecapture/blob/master/LICENSE

Copyright 2022 CFC4N <cfc4n.cs@gmail.com> and eCapture contributors.

The Apache-2.0 license text is included with the eCapture source repository.
This NOTICE exists so operators can see which third-party binary is shipped
in the privileged agent image (T3.2).
